@startuml UC-10
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-10.md
title UC-10: View Addresses
footer Feature PROF-03 | Business rules: BR-08, BR-09
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Customer" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "ProfileController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "ProfileService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

U -> MVC : Open address book
MVC -> API : GET /api/profile/addresses
API -> SVC : GetAddressesAsync(currentUserId)
SVC -> DB : Select addresses WHERE UserId = current user\nORDER BY IsDefault DESC (BR-08, BR-09)
DB --> SVC : Addresses
SVC --> API : AddressDto[]
API --> MVC : 200 OK
alt no addresses
  MVC --> U : Show empty address book with "Add address" (UC-11)
else addresses found
  MVC --> U : Show addresses, default first
end

@enduml
